Now, for (1-cos theta+sin theta)/((1+sin theta))

Putting value of θ in the above statement we get,

(1-frac{1)/(sqrt2)+(1)/(sqrt2)}{1+(1)/(sqrt2)}

⇒ (1)/(frac{sqrt2+1){sqrt2}}

⇒ (sqrt2)/(1+sqrt2) = x

**∴ The answer is X.**

